sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Team Scores Page
    participant Controller as TeamController / AdminPaperScoreController
    participant DB as Database
    actor Student

    Admin->>UI: Open team score overview
    UI->>Controller: Request submitted reviews
    Controller->>DB: Retrieve reviews for team papers
    Controller->>Controller: Calculate average final_score
    Controller-->>UI: Display scores and feedback
    Admin->>UI: Optional override with reason
    UI->>Controller: Save override if provided
    Controller->>DB: Update final_score_override fields
    Admin->>UI: Release scores
    UI->>Controller: POST /teams/{team}/release-scores
    Controller->>DB: Set visibility_status published and results_released_at
    Student-->>UI: Can view released result
